<div class="relational-field" @click.outside="productOpen=false"><label for="sale-product">Productos</label><div class="relational-control"><i data-lucide="search"></i><input id="sale-product" x-ref="productInput" role="combobox" aria-autocomplete="list" aria-controls="product-options" :aria-expanded="productOpen" :aria-activedescendant="productIndex>=0 ? 'product-option-'+productOptions[productIndex]?.id : null" x-model="productText" @input="productInputChanged()" @focus="openProductOptions()" @click="openProductOptions()" @keydown.arrow-down.prevent="moveProduct(1)" @keydown.arrow-up.prevent="moveProduct(-1)" @keydown.enter.prevent="chooseProduct()" @keydown.escape.stop="productOpen=false" @keydown.tab="productOpen=false" placeholder="Escribe el nombre del producto" maxlength="120" autocomplete="off" :aria-busy="productLoading"></div>
<div id="product-options" class="relational-options" role="listbox" aria-label="Productos encontrados" x-show="productOpen" x-cloak><p class="relational-message" x-show="productLoading" role="status">Consultando productos…</p><p class="relational-message text-red-600" x-show="productError" x-text="productError" role="alert"></p><p class="relational-message" x-show="!productLoading && !productError && !productOptions.length">No hay productos que coincidan.</p><template x-for="(product,index) in productOptions" :key="product.id"><button type="button" role="option" :id="'product-option-'+product.id" :aria-selected="items.some(i=>Number(i.product_id)===product.id)" :class="{'is-active':productIndex===index}" @mouseenter="productIndex=index" @mousedown.prevent @click="selectProduct(product)"><strong x-text="product.name"></strong><small x-text="'Precio: '+money(cents(product.price))+' · Inicial: '+money(cents(product.initial_amount))"></small></button></template><p class="relational-message" x-show="productHasMore && !productLoading">Escribe más datos para precisar la búsqueda.</p></div></div>
<div class="table-scroll mt-6"><table><thead><tr><th>Producto</th><th>Cantidad</th><th>Precio unitario</th><th>Inicial por unidad</th><th>Subtotal</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><template x-for="(item,index) in items" :key="item.product_id"><tr><td><strong x-text="item.description"></strong><input type="hidden" :name="`items[${index}][product_id]`" :value="item.product_id"></td><td><input type="number" :aria-label="'Cantidad de '+item.description" :name="`items[${index}][quantity]`" x-model="item.quantity" min="1" max="100000" required style="min-width:90px;max-width:120px"></td><td x-text="money(cents(item.unit_price))"></td><td x-text="money(cents(item.initial_amount))"></td><td x-text="money(cents(item.unit_price)*Number(item.quantity||0))"></td><td><button type="button" class="btn secondary" @click="items.splice(index,1)" :aria-label="'Quitar '+item.description">×</button></td></tr></template><tr x-show="!items.length"><td colspan="6" class="empty">Agrega productos para formar el pedido.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div class="review-total"><span>Total del pedido</span><strong x-text="money(total)"></strong></div><div class="review-total"><span>Inicial total programada</span><strong x-text="money(cents(initial))"></strong></div></section>
<section x-show="step===2" x-cloak data-step="2"><h2>Importe e inicial programada</h2><div class="review-total"><span>Total de la venta</span><strong x-text="money(total)"></strong></div><div class="form-grid"><label>Inicial programada ($)<input name="initial_amount" type="number"  :value="initial" readonly min="0" :max="(total/100).toFixed(2)" step="0.01" required></label></div><p class="muted mb-6">La inicial se calcula sumando la inicial de cada producto por su cantidad. Su cobro se registra después, desde la venta o el módulo Pagos.</p><div class="review-total"><span>Saldo a financiar</span><strong x-text="money(balance)"></strong></div></section>
<section x-show="step===3" x-cloak data-step="3"><h2>Configura el calendario</h2><div class="form-grid"><label>Número de cuotas<input type="number" name="installment_count" x-model="count" min="1" max="120" required></label><label>Frecuencia<select name="frequency" x-model="frequency"><option value="weekly">Semanal</option><option value="fortnightly">Quincenal (cada 15 días)</option><option value="monthly">Mensual</option><option value="custom">Fechas e importes personalizados</option></select></label><label>Primer vencimiento<input type="date" name="first_due" x-model="first" required></label></div><p class="muted">Los importes se distribuyen a céntimos exactos. Los meses conservan el día original cuando existe.</p></section>
<section x-show="step===4" x-cloak data-step="4"><h2>Revisa el cronograma</h2><p class="muted mb-6">Saldo a financiar: <strong x-text="money(balance)"></strong></p><div class="schedule-row" x-show="cents(initial)>0"><strong>Inicial</strong><span>Pendiente de pago al crear la venta</span><strong x-text="money(cents(initial))"></strong></div><template x-for="(row,index) in schedule" :key="index"><div class="schedule-row"><strong x-text="`Cuota ${index+1}`"></strong><template x-if="frequency==='custom'"><div class="schedule-inputs"><input type="date" :name="`custom[${index}][due_date]`" x-model="custom[index].due_date" required><input type="number" step="0.01" min="0.01" :name="`custom[${index}][amount]`" x-model="custom[index].amount" required></div></template><template x-if="frequency!=='custom'"><div class="flex gap-8"><span x-text="row.date"></span><strong x-text="money(row.amount)"></strong></div></template></div></template><div x-show="frequency==='custom'" class="review-total"><span>Total programado</span><strong x-text="money(customTotal)" :class="{'text-red-600':customTotal!==balance}"></strong></div><p x-show="balance===0" class="notice success">La venta se programará como una sola inicial pendiente, sin cuotas adicionales.</p></section>
<section x-show="step===5" x-cloak data-step="5"><h2>Todo listo para confirmar</h2><div class="review-total"><span>Total</span><strong x-text="money(total)"></strong></div><div class="review-total"><span>Inicial pendiente de pago</span><strong x-text="money(cents(initial))"></strong></div><div class="review-total"><span>Saldo financiado</span><strong x-text="money(balance)"></strong></div><label>Observaciones<textarea name="notes" maxlength="3000">{{ old('notes') }}</textarea></label><p class="muted">Al confirmar se guardarán el pedido, la inicial pendiente y el calendario de cuotas. No se registrará ningún pago.</p></section>
